# Q39 (graph part). What breaks downstream if a process changes? (processes that depend on its output, are triggered by it, or are informed by it)
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX core: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/core/>
PREFIX mod: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/>
PREFIX apqc: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/core/apqc-mapping-decision/>

SELECT ?changed ?p ?affected WHERE { VALUES ?p { core:dependsOnOutputOf core:triggeredBy core:informedBy } ?affected ?p ?changed . }
